=== meta ===
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: configuring pytest for the first time is not weakening the test command
origin: field integration 2026-08-07 — there was no test command to weaken.
origin2: A scope knob in a file that did not exist at base establishes a scope;
origin3: it does not narrow one. Reported at warn, which is visible.
=== after: pyproject.toml ===
[tool.pytest.ini_options]
testpaths = ["tests"]
